  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to meet basic needs through the Special Trust Fund for Afghanistan (STFA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project responds to the second and third strategic priorities of the UN Transitional Engagement Framework for Afghanistan, which are: Second priority; By the end of the project, essential services are sustained that address basic human needs for the people in Afghanistan and Third priority; By the end of the project, Afghanistan will preserve social investments and community-level systems essential to meeting basic human needs, protect gains to the SDGs, and develop scenarios for future engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
